Package: secretsway
Version: 1.2.0
Maintainer: Mr.E <mr.e.developer.ai345@gmail.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Recommends: fonts-jetbrains-mono, sway
Suggests: gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0
Homepage: https://github.com/mysterion-the-ai-developer-345/SecretSway
Description: terminal-styled application launcher for sway
 A full-width launcher strip for Wayland compositors that look like a shell:
 dark background, monospace text, no icons, and a prompt line.
 .
 Applications come from the same freedesktop .desktop entries fuzzel reads, so
 the list matches what the desktop already provides. Launched applications are
 remembered and ordered by use, with the most recent one pinned to the top.
 .
 The strip is a wlr-layer-shell overlay, so it needs gtk4-layer-shell. That
 package is not available on every release -- run
 /usr/lib/secretsway/install-layer-shell.sh if the launcher reports that it
 cannot find the Gtk4LayerShell typelib.
